<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Welcome to Stutris</title>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        color: #000000;
      }

      .email-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 30px 0;
      }

      .outer-container {
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        border: 1px solid #d5eeee;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 18px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .container {
        background-color: #f6fbfb;
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 28px 48px 34px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .accent-row {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        font-size: 0;
        line-height: 0;
      }

      .accent {
        display: inline-block;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-right: 6px;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .accent.teal {
        width: 135px;
        background-color: #5fa6a6;
      }

      .accent.orange {
        width: 42px;
        background-color: #f26543;
      }

      .accent.purple {
        width: 42px;
        background-color: #969be8;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #2f6f72;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 27px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin: 0 0 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      h2 {
        color: #2f6f72;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin: 26px 0 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      p {
        color: #000000;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }

      strong {
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .steps {
        margin: 8px 0 22px;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .step {
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .step-number {
        display: table-cell;
        width: 30px;
        color: #000000;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 700;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .step-text {
        display: table-cell;
        color: #000000;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.35;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .button-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 26px 0 24px;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #6bbdae;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 28px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.2;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .notice-box {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #cfe6e6;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 26px auto;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .notice-title {
        color: #000000;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 14px;
      }

      .notice-text {
        color: #253233;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.35;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .signature {
        margin-top: 28px;
      }

      .signature p {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      .footer p {
        color: #2f6f72;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.4;
        margin: 0 0 4px;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #2f6f72;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      @media only screen and (max-width: 700px) {
        .email-wrapper {
          padding: 14px 0;
        }

        .outer-container {
          max-width: 94%;
          padding: 10px;
          border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .container {
          padding: 22px 20px 28px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 23px;
          white-space: normal;
        }

        p,
        .step-number,
        .step-text {
          font-size: 15px;
        }

        .accent.teal {
          width: 120px;
        }

        .notice-box {
          max-width: 100%;
        }
      }
    </style>

  </head>

  <body>
    <div class='email-wrapper'>
      <div class='outer-container'>
        <div class='container'>

          <div class='accent-row'>
            <span class='accent teal'></span>
            <span class='accent orange'></span>
            <span class='accent purple'></span>
          </div>

          <h1>Welcome to Stutris - Your Registration Is Complete</h1>

          <p>Hi {{companyName}} Team,</p>

          <p>
            Welcome to
            <strong>Stutris</strong>! We are excited to support your team with smarter roster planning, clearer
            enrollment visibility, and a more organized way to manage classroom capacity.
          </p>

          <p>
            Your company registration has been received, and your Stutris account is now ready for setup.
          </p>

          <h2>What happens next</h2>

          <p>
            Your designated account administrator will receive access and contact you to schedule a 30-minute demo call.
            During this call, we will walk you through how to use Stutris, set up your account, and begin entering your
            school, classroom, student, and enrollment details. Once your information is added, Stutris will help you
            track current rosters, upcoming transitions, future withdrawals, and available openings with greater
            clarity.
          </p>

          <h2>Your next steps</h2>

          <div class='steps'>
            <div class='step'>
              <div class='step-number'>1.</div>
              <div class='step-text'>
                Watch for communication from your Stutris account administrator to schedule your 30-minute demo call.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class='step'>
              <div class='step-number'>2.</div>
              <div class='step-text'>
                Log in to your Stutris account.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class='step'>
              <div class='step-number'>3.</div>
              <div class='step-text'>
                Add your company and school details.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class='step'>
              <div class='step-number'>4.</div>
              <div class='step-text'>
                Set up classrooms, capacity, and enrollment information.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {{#if loginUrl}}
            <div class='button-wrapper'>
              <a href='{{loginUrl}}' class='button'>Log in to Stutris</a>
            </div>
          {{/if}}

          <p>
            Stutris is designed to help childcare leaders move from reactive enrollment management to proactive planning
            - so every child can be placed in their perfect spot.
          </p>

          <div class='notice-box'>
            <p class='notice-title'>Confidentiality &amp; Proprietary Use Notice</p>

            <p class='notice-text'>
              Stutris is a proprietary roster management platform. Access to the system, training materials, reports,
              templates, workflows, and related content is intended only for authorized users within your company.
              Please do not share login credentials, screenshots, reports, or platform information with outside parties
              without written permission from Stutris.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p>
            If you have any questions during setup, our team is here to help.
          </p>

          <div class='signature'>
            <p>Warmly,</p>
            <p><strong>The Stutris Team</strong></p>
          </div>

          <div class='footer'>
            <p>
              Enrollment clarity. Smarter rosters. Every child in their perfect spot.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href='mailto:{{supportEmail}}'>{{supportEmail}}</a>
              |
              <a href='{{websiteUrl}}'>{{websiteUrl}}</a>
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </body>
</html>